{"code":"001067","name":"JW중외제약2우B","market":"KOSPI","sector_name":"제약","sector_desc":"의약품을 개발·생산·판매. 신약 파이프라인과 임상 결과, 약가 정책에 주가가 크게 반응합니다.","desc":"동사는 1945년 '조선중외제약소'로 출범하여 1953년 '대한중외제약 주식회사'로 법인을 설립하였으며, 1976년 유가증권시장에 상장하였음. 2019년 베트남 Euvipharm社를 100% 인수하며 이머징 시장으로 사업영역을 확장하였음. 동사는 의약품의 연구, 개발, 제조, 판매를 주요 사업으로 영위하며, 리바로, 헴리브라 등 오리지널 전문의약품과 위너프, 화콜, 하이맘 등 일반의약품 및 헬스케어 제품을 공급하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-16","n_days":300,"close":49850.0,"open":49000.0,"high":49850.0,"low":49000.0,"volume":3,"amount":149550.0,"ret_1d":-0.1002,"gap":-1.8036,"range_pct":1.7051,"ret_5":-0.2002,"ret_20":2.9959,"ret_60":14.8618,"ret_120":-10.0181,"ret_250":-16.6388,"ma20":49982.5,"ma60":46978.3333,"ma120":47586.25,"ma200":51779.75,"close_vs_ma200":-3.7268,"close_vs_ma60":6.1127,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":137.442,"r2_60":0.875,"slope_120":-12.9152,"r2_120":0.0476,"slope_250":-30.7329,"r2_250":0.6951,"high52":61500.0,"low52":38500.0,"pos_52w":49.3478,"dd_52w":-18.9431,"mdd_1y":-33.3333,"atr14_pct":1.5117,"vol_ann_60":25.8849,"vol_avg20":20.4,"vol_ratio20":0.1471,"vr5":0.1269,"vr20":0.2896,"amount_avg5":330170.0,"amount_avg20":1022160.0,"amount_avg60":2341581.6667,"obv_chg20":-46.8137,"turnover_20":0.1943,"pv_eff_20":15.4179,"rsi14":55.0619,"frgn_net_5":0.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_20":0.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.0,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_60":0.0,"inst_net_60":-10.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.0,"inst_net_60_pct":-0.0048,"smart_net_60_pct":-0.0048,"frgn_net_120":12.0,"inst_net_120":-10.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.0057,"inst_net_120_pct":-0.0048,"smart_net_120_pct":0.001,"foreign_ratio":0.15,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.02,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":333.0,"op_margin_q":15.0,"op_qoq":-0.8929,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":33.2,"rev_yoy":16.1695,"op_trend_4q":7.6923,"fin_period":"202606","roe":27.63,"debt_ratio":60.98,"per":12.26,"pbr":2.94,"div_yield":1.3,"foreign_rate":0.15